    <briefdescription>
<para>Reusable geometry plan for a block&apos;s halo. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>ghostIndices maps padded indices to compact halo slots; interior indices use a sentinel. The plan contains no stage values and may be reused between updates. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
